# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2301
translate Portugues skypause3_8553afbb:

#   k "There was a woman who lived in a room that forgot itself."
    k "Havia uma mulher que morava num quarto que se esquecia de si mesmo."

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2302
translate Portugues skypause3_3fa4fff9:

#   k "Once, it carried voices, shelves bending under books, windows that breathed with the weather."
    k "Outrora, era um lugar onde se ouviam vozes, com prateleiras curvadas sob o peso dos livros e janelas que respiravam com o clima."

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2303
translate Portugues skypause3_dabe0fc4:

#   k "But someone left. And the walls went still, like they didn't trust sound anymore."
