# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2305
translate Portugues skypause3_eea950e4:

#   k "Eventually, she stopped lighting candles. Said the glow made the quiet lean in too close."
    k "Por fim, ela parou de acender velas. Disse que a luz fazia o silêncio se aproximar demais."

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2308
translate Portugues skypause3_068659e2:

#   k "The windows crusted over. She told herself the sun would pry too much out of her if she let it in."
    k "As janelas estavam embaçadas. Ela disse a si mesma que o sol lhe roubaria demais se o deixasse entrar."

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2309
translate Portugues skypause3_bca3fc51:

#   k "So no one knocked. And she never touched the latch."
